      "message": "refactor: split stock_sim, stock_play and the drilling tests along their seams\n\nThree files were past the 400-line limit (#2528 item 4):\n\n- stock_sim.rs (469): the program plan moves to stock_sim_plan.rs.\n- stock_play.rs (409): PlayIndex and PlaySeed move to\n  stock_play_index.rs.\n- drilling/tests.rs (508): the hole recognition tests move to\n  tests_recognize.rs.\n\nStructure only: the moved items are re-exported where callers name\nthem, and the #[test] counts stay the same (app lib 322, motion lib\n777).\n\nRefs #2528\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
