      "message": "fix(drilling): the Break-through note names the field and the drill point\n\nA drill measured from its full diameter said \"through holes run 2.803\nmm past the part bottom (Break-through)\" for a 1 mm Break-through. The\nnote now names both values: \"(Break-through 1.000 mm from the full\ndiameter, plus the 1.803 mm drill point)\". Every other case keeps the\nold words.\n\nPinned by break_through::tests::a_full_diameter_drill_names_the_field_and_its_point\n(motion) and the_default_is_today_s_millimetre_and_is_said (app).\n\nRefs #2528\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
