      "message": "fix(ui): disable Break-through from where it has no effect\n\nThe selector showed on a lathe's axial drill (always Tip), with a\nstated Bottom, on spot, tap and ream cycles, and with no through hole.\nIn each case the combo is now disabled and its hint names the reason\n(holes_page::break_through_from_idle, in the generator's order).\n\nPinned by drill_break_through_from_is_disabled_where_it_has_no_effect.\n\nRefs #2528\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
