      "message": "test(post): every post records a full-diameter through hole\n\nA new recorded stream, drill_full_diameter (one 10 mm through hole, the\ndefault Full diameter, tip at Z-12.803), joins the per-post suites. Each\npost records its golden: 15 programs write Z-12.803 and the posts that do\nnot drill this stream keep their named refusals. No existing golden\nchanges.\n\nFixes #2528\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
