  {
    "sha": "15626f3331bc6e9603548c84958178cf4d57e88e",
    "node_id": "C_kwDOVyT_AdoAKDE1NjI2ZjMzMzFiYzZlOTYwMzU0OGM4NDk1ODE3OGNmNGQ1N2U4OGU",
    "commit": {
      "author": {
        "name": "Mike Kinney",
        "email": "mike.kinney@gmail.com",
        "date": "2026-11-27T22:17:58Z"
      },
      "committer": {
        "name": "Mike Kinney",
        "email": "mike.kinney@gmail.com",
        "date": "2026-11-27T22:17:58Z"
      },
      "message": "fix(ui): idle the Break-through from choice by the generator's tool rule\n\nThe choice was live for Auto with a tap, a boring bar or an end mill,\nand for a flat-bottom drill. The generator adds no point cone for those\ntools, so the choice had no effect. The page now asks the generator's\nown rule (drilling::through_tip_run from the full diameter, with no\nallowance) for the selected tool and cycle. A zero point disables the\nchoice, with the reason on hover. An unknown tool or a refused tip\nangle keeps the choice live.\n\nPinned by holes_break_through::drill_break_through_from_is_idle_for_a_tool_without_a_point\nand drill_break_through_from_page_disables_a_tap_and_a_flat_drill_on_auto.\n\nRefs #2528\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
