      "message": "test: follow main's G94 preambles and accessible row names\n\n- fanuc and doosan-dnm drill_full_diameter goldens: written again with\n  WRITE_GOLDEN=1 after #4382; only the preamble line gains G94 (and G17\n  on Fanuc).\n- holes_break_through: hover the row's Label node. Since cf3565107 the\n  row's controls carry the row label as their name, so get_by_label can\n  find the combo, and its centre shows no label tooltip.\n\nRefs #2528\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
